Package: transform
Type: Package
Title: Automatic Normalizing Transformations
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tests a numeric vector for normality and, if it is non-normal,
    evaluates log, square-root, Box-Cox, Yeo-Johnson and rank-based inverse
    normal (Blom) transformations, selects the one that is closest to
    normality, and returns an object that can be inverted back to the
    original scale.
